{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788348471748,"sessionID":"ses_f9e20155cffePEnQZzaxI6Q8lc","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_db9120b6cdf64a8091661473","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/aloschilov/workspace/pyasc-skill-stack/integrations/cannbench/workers/.scratch/20260902_140812/foreach_addcdiv_scalar-generate/task.md"},"output":"<path>/home/aloschilov/workspace/pyasc-skill-stack/integrations/cannbench/workers/.scratch/20260902_140812/foreach_addcdiv_scalar-generate/task.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: You are implementing ONE operator for the CANN Bench benchmark (https://gitcode.com/cann/cann-bench) as a pyasc asc2 JIT kernel module targeting an Ascend 950PR NPU. You have NO NPU access — the official harness evaluates your file on real hardware after you finish. Score per operator = 0.2 compile + 0.3 accuracy (all 20 cases must pass a relative-error check against golden.py) + 0.5 performance (profiler-measured kernel time vs an aclnn baseline).\n2: \n3: # Task\n4: \n5: Operator: **ForeachAddcdivScalar**. Write the file `candidate.py` in the current working directory: a complete Python module whose public callable `foreach_addcdiv_scalar` implements the schema below. Nothing else — no tests, no other files.\n6: \n7: # Operator specification\n8: \n9: ## desc.md\n10: \n11: # ForeachAddcdivScalar 算子 API 描述\n12: \n13: ## 1. 算子简介\n14: \n15: ForeachAddcdivScalar 算子对多个张量列表进行逐元素的加、除、乘复合操作，是优化器（如 Adam）中常用的基础运算。\n16: \n17: **主要应用场景**：\n18: - Adam / AdamW 优化器的参数更新步骤\n19: - 需要对多组参数同时执行 addcdiv 运算的场景\n20: - 分布式训练中的批量参数更新\n21: \n22: **算子特征**：\n23: - 难度等级：L1（FusedComposite）\n24: - 三组 TensorList 输入，逐元素复合运算，输出 TensorList 与输入 shape 一致\n25: \n26: ## 2. 算子定义\n27: \n28: ### 数学公式\n29: \n30: 对列表中第 $i$ 个张量：\n31: \n32: $$\n33: y_i = x1_i + \\frac{x2_i}{x3_i} \\cdot scalar\n34: $$\n35: \n36: ## 3. 接口规范\n37: \n38: ### 算子原型\n39: \n40: ```python\n41: cann_bench.foreach_addcdiv_scalar(Tensor[] x1, Tensor[] x2, Tensor[] x3, float scalar) -> Tensor[] y\n42: ```\n43: \n44: ### 输入参数说明\n45: \n46: | 参数 | 类型 | 默认值 | 描述 |\n47: |------|------|--------|------|\n48: | x1 | Tensor[] | 必选 | 第 1 个输入张量列表（TensorList），被加数 |\n49: | x2 | Tensor[] | 必选 | 第 2 个输入张量列表（TensorList），被除数的分子 |\n50: | x3 | Tensor[] | 必选 | 第 3 个输入张量列表（TensorList），被除数的分母 |\n51: | scalar | float | 必选 | 缩放因子 |\n52: \n53: ### 输出\n54: \n55: | 参数 | Shape | dtype | 描述 |\n56: |------|-------|-------|------|\n57: | y | 与输入 TensorList 各元素 shape 相同 | 与输入 dtype 相同 | 逐元素复合运算结果列表 |\n58: \n59: ### 数据类型\n60: \n61: | 输入 dtype | 输出 dtype |\n62: |-----------|-----------|\n63: | float16 | float16 |\n64: | float32 | float32 |\n65: | bfloat16 | bfloat16 |\n66: \n67: ### 规则与约束\n68: \n69: - x1、x2、x3 三个 TensorList 长度必须相同\n70: - 对应位置的张量 shape 必须一致\n71: - 列表中各张量的 dtype 须一致\n72: - x3 中的元素不应为零（除以零会产生 inf/nan）\n73: \n74: ### 支持范围\n75: \n76: 输入 tensor 各维度与参数的支持范围：\n77: \n78: | 维度 / 参数 | 范围 | 备注 |\n79: |---|---|---|\n80: | TensorList 长度（`L`） | 1 ~ 64 | cases.csv 实测 1 ~ 4；x1/x2/x3 三个列表长度必须相同 |\n81: | 每个张量维度数 | 1 ~ 8 | cases.csv 实测 1D ~ 5D |\n82: | 每个张量各维大小 | 1 ~ 1048576 | cases.csv 各维实测 2 ~ 8193（含 1D 张量长度 1000003） |\n83: | 每个张量元素总数 | 1 ~ 64M | cases.csv 实测 ~1M ~ 64M |\n84: | `scalar` | -1024.0 ~ 1024.0 | cases.csv 实测 -1.0 ~ 2.0（含 inf / nan 特殊值） |\n85: \n86: 约束：x1[i]、x2[i]、x3[i] 三者 shape 与 dtype 必须一致；x3 中元素应非零。\n87: \n88: ## 4. 精度要求\n89: \n90: 采用[生态算子精度标准](https://gitcode.com/cann/opbase/blob/master/docs/zh/ops_precision_standard/experimental_standard.md)进行验证。\n91: \n92: **误差指标**：\n93: \n94: 1. 平均相对误差（MERE）：采样点中相对误差平均值\n95: \n96:    $$\n97:    \\text{MERE} = \\text{avg}(\\frac{\\text{abs}(actual - golden)}{\\text{abs}(golden)+\\text{1e-7}})\n98:    $$\n99: \n100: 2. 最大相对误差（MARE）：采样点中相对误差最大值\n101: \n102:    $$\n103:    \\text{MARE} = \\max(\\frac{\\text{abs}(actual - golden)}{\\text{abs}(golden)+\\text{1e-7}})\n104:    $$\n105: \n106: **通过标准**：\n107: \n108: | 数据类型 | FLOAT16 | BFLOAT16 | FLOAT32 | HiFLOAT32 | FLOAT8 E4M3 | FLOAT8 E5M2 |\n109: |----------|---------|----------|---------|-----------|-------------|-------------|\n110: | **通过阈值(Threshold)** | 2^-10 | 2^-7 | 2^-13 | 2^-11 | 2^-3 | 2^-2 |\n111: \n112: 当平均相对误差 MERE < Threshold，最大相对误差 MARE < 10 * Threshold 时判定为通过。\n113: \n114: \n115: ## 5. 标准 Golden 代码\n116: \n117: ```python\n118: import torch\n119: from typing import List\n120: \n121: def foreach_addcdiv_scalar(\n122:     x1: List[torch.Tensor], x2: List[torch.Tensor], x3: List[torch.Tensor], scalar: float\n123: ) -> List[torch.Tensor]:\n124:     \"\"\"\n125:     对多个张量进行逐元素加、乘、除操作\n126: \n127:     公式：y_i = x1_i + (x2_i / x3_i) * scalar\n128: \n129:     Args:\n130:         x1: 第 1 个输入张量列表 (TensorList)\n131:         x2: 第 2 个输入张量列表 (TensorList)\n132:         x3: 第 3 个输入张量列表 (TensorList)\n133:         scalar: 缩放因子\n134: \n135:     Returns:\n136:         输出张量列表\n137:     \"\"\"\n138: \n139:     # FP16/BF16 输入为保证精度会先提升到 FP32 计算\n140:     input_dtype = x1[0].dtype if x1 else torch.float32\n141:     compute_dtype = torch.float32 if input_dtype in (torch.float16, torch.bfloat16) else input_dtype\n142: \n143:     x1_compute = [t.to(compute_dtype) for t in x1]\n144:     x2_compute = [t.to(compute_dtype) for t in x2]\n145:     x3_compute = [t.to(compute_dtype) for t in x3]\n146: \n147:     y = [x1_i + (x2_i / x3_i) * scalar for x1_i, x2_i, x3_i in zip(x1_compute, x2_compute, x3_compute)]\n148: \n149:     # 计算完成后恢复到输入 dtype\n150:     if input_dtype in (torch.float16, torch.bfloat16):\n151:         return [t.to(input_dtype) for t in y]\n152:     return y\n153: ```\n154: \n155: ## 6. 额外信息\n156: \n157: ### 算子调用示例\n158: \n159: ```python\n160: import torch\n161: import cann_bench\n162: \n163: x1 = [torch.randn(1024, 1024, dtype=torch.float32, device=\"npu\")]\n164: x2 = [torch.randn(1024, 1024, dtype=torch.float32, device=\"npu\")]\n165: x3 = [torch.rand(1024, 1024, dtype=torch.float32, device=\"npu\") + 0.1]  # 避免除零\n166: y = cann_bench.foreach_addcdiv_scalar(x1, x2, x3, scalar=1.0)\n167: ```\n168: \n169: ## proto.yaml\n170: \n171: ```yaml\n172: operator:\n173:   name: ForeachAddcdivScalar\n174:   category: FusedComposite\n175:   difficulty: L1\n176:   formula: y_i = x1_i + (x2_i / x3_i) * scalar\n177:   description: 对多个张量进行逐元素加、乘、除操作\n178:   shape_support: 输入 shape 必须一致\n179:   attrs:\n180:   - name: scalar\n181:     type: float\n182:     description: 缩放因子\n183:     required: true\n184:   inputs:\n185:   - name: x1\n186:     description: 第 1 个输入张量列表 (TensorList)\n187:     dtype:\n188:     - float32\n189:     - float16\n190:     - bfloat16\n191:     is_list: true\n192:   - name: x2\n193:     description: 第 2 个输入张量列表 (TensorList)\n194:     dtype:\n195:     - float32\n196:     - float16\n197:     - bfloat16\n198:     is_list: true\n199:   - name: x3\n200:     description: 第 3 个输入张量列表 (TensorList)\n201:     dtype:\n202:     - float32\n203:     - float16\n204:     - bfloat16\n205:     is_list: true\n206:   outputs:\n207:   - name: y\n208:     description: 输出张量列表\n209:     dtype:\n210:     - float32\n211:     - float16\n212:     - bfloat16\n213:   schema: foreach_addcdiv_scalar(Tensor[] x1, Tensor[] x2, Tensor[] x3, float scalar) -> Tensor[] y\n214:   # 除法类算子精度敏感，使用更宽松的阈值\n215:   precision_thresholds:\n216:     float32: 0.005  # 除法类算子精度敏感，需要一定宽松度\n217:     float16: 0.01   # 除法类算子精度敏感，需要一定宽松度\n218:     bfloat16: 0.01  # 除法类算子精度敏感，需要一定宽松度\n219: ```\n220: \n221: ## golden.py — reference semantics ONLY (you must NOT compute with torch like this; reimplement the math in asc2 kernels)\n222: \n223: ```python\n224: #!/usr/bin/python3\n225: # coding=utf-8\n226: \n227: \n228: import torch\n229: from typing import List\n230: \n231: \"\"\"\n232: ForeachAddcdivScalar 算子 Torch Golden 参考实现\n233: \n234: 对多个张量进行逐元素加、乘、除操作\n235: 公式：y_i = x1_i + (x2_i / x3_i) * scalar\n236: \"\"\"\n237: def foreach_addcdiv_scalar(\n238:     x1: List[torch.Tensor], x2: List[torch.Tensor], x3: List[torch.Tensor], scalar: float\n239: ) -> List[torch.Tensor]:\n240:     \"\"\"\n241:     对多个张量进行逐元素加、乘、除操作\n242: \n243:     公式：y_i = x1_i + (x2_i / x3_i) * scalar\n244: \n245:     Args:\n246:         x1: 第 1 个输入张量列表 (TensorList)\n247:         x2: 第 2 个输入张量列表 (TensorList)\n248:         x3: 第 3 个输入张量列表 (TensorList)\n249:         scalar: 缩放因子\n250: \n251:     Returns:\n252:         输出张量列表\n253:     \"\"\"\n254:     # 检测输入 dtype\n255:     input_dtype = x1[0].dtype if x1 else torch.float32\n256: \n257:     # FP16/BF16 输入需要升到 FP32 计算以保证精度\n258:     # FP32/FP64 输入保持原样计算\n259:     if input_dtype in (torch.float16, torch.bfloat16):\n260:         compute_dtype = torch.float32\n261:     else:\n262:         compute_dtype = input_dtype\n263: \n264:     # 转换到计算精度\n265:     x1_compute = [t.to(compute_dtype) for t in x1]\n266:     x2_compute = [t.to(compute_dtype) for t in x2]\n267:     x3_compute = [t.to(compute_dtype) for t in x3]\n268: \n269:     # 计算\n270:     y = [x1_i + (x2_i / x3_i) * scalar for x1_i, x2_i, x3_i in zip(x1_compute, x2_compute, x3_compute)]\n271: \n272:     # 转回原始 dtype\n273:     if input_dtype in (torch.float16, torch.bfloat16):\n274:         return [t.to(input_dtype) for t in y]\n275:     return y\n276: ```\n277: \n278: ## Evaluation cases your module must handle (shapes, dtypes, value ranges, attrs)\n279: \n280: | case | shapes | dtype | value_range | attrs |\n281: |---|---|---|---|---|\n282: | 1 | [[[1024, 1024], [1024, 1024]], [[1024, 1024], [1024, 1024]], [[1024, 1024], [1024, 1024]]] | ['float32'] | [[-1.0, 1.0], [-1.0, 1.0], [0.5, 1.0]] | {'scalar': 1.0} |\n283: | 2 | [[[2048, 2048], [2048, 2048], [2048, 2048]], [[2048, 2048], [2048, 2048], [2048, 2048]], [[2048, 2048], [2048, 2048], [2048, 2048]]] | ['float16'] | [[-2.0, 2.0], [-2.0, 2.0], [1.0, 2.0]] | {'scalar': 1.0} |\n284: | 3 | [[[4096, 4096]], [[4096, 4096]], [[4096, 4096]]] | ['bfloat16'] | [[-3.0, 3.0], [-3.0, 3.0], [0.3, 3.0]] | {'scalar': 1.0} |\n285: | 4 | [[[8192, 8192]], [[8192, 8192]], [[8192, 8192]]] | ['float32'] | [[1.0, 10.0], [-10.0, 10.0], [5.0, 10.0]] | {'scalar': 0.5} |\n286: | 5 | [[[8192, 4096], [8192, 4096]], [[8192, 4096], [8192, 4096